    "updated_at": "2022-02-24T18:38:01Z",
    "body": "On Apple platforms, there is no distinction between focus & selection. As such, we need to tie them together. On Windows, focus & selection are two distinct concepts so you can have a focus but not necessarily selection and vice versa.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
