    "created_at": "2022-02-24T19:13:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-02-24T19:13:33Z",
    "body": "> On Apple platforms, there is no distinction between focus & selection. As such, we need to tie them together.\r\n\r\nThis doesn't appear to be Apple platform-wide thing, but instead a choice Safari has made on Apple platforms. (The demo at https://bug1755215.bmoattachments.org/attachment.cgi?id=9263674 has separate selection and focus in Chrome on Apple platforms.)\r\n\r\nWe probably still want the spec to allow different user agents to make different decisions here, like we already do for, e.g., what controls are focusable.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/1050175635/reactions",
