    "updated_at": "2022-02-25T05:35:13Z",
    "body": "FWIW, I think in Gecko we also tie them together. I think not doing so is a bit weird, since keydown events and so get dispatched to the focused element... For example, why would a keydown event listener in a link prevent the user from copying a visible selection in a totally unrelated part of the page?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
